        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Provide the enumeration of possible decisions in the\nStakeholder-Specific Vulnerability Categorization (SSVC) decision tree <https://www.cisa.gov/stakeholder-specific-vulnerability-categorization-ssvc>."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A decisionType is a mandatory value and shall select one of the four entries in\nthe SsvcDecisionType vocabulary."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/hsCodes",
