        "@value": "A map of Element identifiers that are used within an SpdxDocument but defined\nexternal to that SpdxDocument."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An external map is a map of Element identifiers that are used within an\nSpdxDocument but defined external to that SpdxDocument.\nThe external map provides details about the externally-defined Element\nsuch as its provenance, where to retrieve it, and how to verify its integrity."
      }
