        "@value": "A class that represents a measured quantity paired with a unit of measure from the QUDT ontology."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "UnitOfMeasure class provides a structured way to express measurements: such as size, weight, volume, or other quantities.\nIt combines a numerical value quantity with a unit reference unitQUDT that points to a URI in the QUDT (Quantity, Unit, Dimension and Type) ontology.\nThe QUDT ontology and specifications are available at www.qudt.org <https://www.qudt.org/>."
      }
    ],
